From 521f173cadbb72f7537f1da6fe2e2785ec34d4cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 22:05:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add experimental --target dc output for Dreamcast (SH-4)

Rewrites emitted TUs for a small 32-bit host: direct guest memory access,
MIPS GPRs/HI/LO cached in C locals with write-back at observation points,
shared cold interrupt stub per function, optional MMU-mapped guest RAM.
Includes a synthetic SH-4 benchmark harness and measurements.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
